sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Guest Companion PWA
    participant GG as Guest Growth (Spot Saver Client)
    participant Kafka as CloudEvents Kafka Backbone
    participant LC as Living Collection (Sole Capacity Authority)
    participant Sensors as Enclosure Bio-Sensors (VLAN 10/20)
    participant PO as Park Operations (Routing / Wait Times)

    Note over LC,Sensors: Continuous Biological Welfare Monitoring
    Sensors->>LC: Water DO2 drops / Ambient Noise Spikes (Acoustic Stress)
    Note over LC: Biological Welfare Engine evaluates thresholds
    LC->>LC: Clamp Exhibit Capacity: 50 -> 20 guests/slot
    LC->>Kafka: Publish: ExhibitAvailabilityChanged.v1 (enclosure_id, availability=capped, capacityCap=20)
    Kafka-->>GG: Sync Available Slot Cache in Redis (Enforce 20-slot ceiling)

    Note over Guest,GG: Guest Requests Spot Saver Booking
    Guest->>GG: Request Spot Saver Pass (Amazonia Viewing - 14:00 Window)
    GG->>PO: Query Walking Transit Feasibility (GIS / Crowd Density)
    PO-->>GG: Transit OK (Guest within 12 min reachable perimeter)
    GG->>Kafka: Publish: VisitRequested.v1 (guest_id="g-892", exhibit_id="amazonia-01", window="14:00-14:15")
    Kafka->>LC: Consume VisitRequested.v1
    
    alt Capacity Available within Bio-Clamp
        Note over LC: Validate slot against clamped ceiling (Headcount < 20)
        LC->>Kafka: Publish: VisitConfirmed.v1 (id=ULID, exhibit_id="amazonia-01", slot_token="ss-tok-4891")
        Kafka-->>GG: Consume VisitConfirmed.v1
        GG-->>Guest: 200 OK (Confirmed Pass with Ed25519 QR Added to Wallet)
    else Bio-Clamp Exceeded (Slots Saturated)
        Note over LC: Reject: Welfare limit reached
        LC->>Kafka: Publish: VisitDenied.v1 (exhibit_id="amazonia-01", reason="CapacityCapped", alt_windows)
        Kafka-->>GG: Consume VisitDenied.v1
        GG->>GG: Anti-Congestion Recommender generates alternative itinerary
        GG-->>Guest: Advisory: "Amazonia resting — recommended Grand Carousel (5 min wait)"
    end

    Note over Guest,LC: In-Park Admission Verification
    Guest->>LC: Scans QR at Amazonia Viewing Turnstile (Edge Verifier)
    LC->>LC: Validate Token & Increment Live Dwell Headcount
    LC-->>Guest: Gate Opens (Quiet Viewing Period Active)
